example:
csrWrapper.api.user.update({ 
userId: '69aa174aba9d8bf27771b282',
firstName: 'kim',
});

You can pass email, password, firstName, lastName, roles, shConId, and shColId that can be entered when creating a user. (optional)

csrWrapper.api.user.findAdmin({ 
brandId: 'idlookup',
});

The response value returns N Users. To obtain more than N response values, pass the _id of the User received in the response to lastId. The first page does not pass lastId.

params
- brandId: (optional)
- email: (optional)
- lastId: (optional)

csrWrapper.api.user.createAdminNote({ 
userId: '69aa174aba9d8bf27771b282', 
message: 'Create a Memo in User that only administrators can see.'
contentType: 'text/html',
});

Added on 2026-03-31
attachments: (optional) File[]
- You can add attachments to the request value.
contentType
- contentType: text/plain or text/html

csrWrapper.api.user.updateAdminNote({ 
messageId: '69af35499c5bb16194bfd741', 
message: 'Edit the message content.' 
});

