example:
csrWrapper.api.user.updateScheduleDueTimestamp({ 
scheduleId: '69ab30d530ad87f2692196b3',
dueTimestamp: 1775371111111,
});

params
- scheduleId: order.schedule._id
- dueTimestamp: (number)

csrWrapper.api.optOut.find({ 
status: 'requested',
});

params
- status: (optional) requested, active
- brandId: (optional)
- email: (optional)
- provider: (optional)
- targetId: (optional)
- lastId: (optional) You can get the next optOut by passing the _id of the last optOut.

csrWrapper.api.contact.find({ 
status: 'requested',
});

params
- status: (optional) requested, fulfilled
- brandId: (optional)
- email: (optional)
- lastId: (optional) You can get the next optOut by passing the _id of the last contact.

csrWrapper.api.managedContact.unsubscribe({ managedContactId });

params
- managedContactId: Find the _id (managedContactId) in the documentation of the ManagedContacts response.
